      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners speak highly of Dr. Hurcombe, Dr. Meade, and Dr. Shim for their clinical competence and compassionate approach to dogs, cats, and exotics. While a couple of reviews mention frustrations with recent vet turnover, clients widely appreciate the patience shown during stressful clinic visits."
