      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for diverse species"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers repeatedly note the team's ability to soothe nervous dogs, spirited cats, and exotic animals including axolotls and fish. Pet parents feel reassured by the calm handling methods used during sedated visits and medical examinations for reactive or frightened pets."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
