      "title": {
        "en": "Effective treatments and urgent surgeries"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple clients credit the clinic with saving pets through life-saving soft tissue operations and resolving complex gastrointestinal illnesses. Aside from an isolated complaint regarding delayed medication delivery, owners report reliable outcomes for both routine and surgical care."
      }
    }
